      "content": "okay i get it. honestly my doctor is so hard to reach and it takes forever to get an appointment just for something small like this. i'm really struggling with my mood though and i don't want to wait weeks for a call back. if i just took a really small dose of the st johns wort, like half a pill or something, would that be okay? would it still be dangerous if i'm careful with the amount?",
